{"about_the_game":"Dodging and attacking with the MUSIC!<br>Let us move with the BEAT!<br>The game starts now! ( \u30ce ^o^)\u30ce<br><br>Just a rhythm game?<br>Just a bullet-hell?<br>Is there a way to have it all?<br>Then let us get Hi on the Rhythm!!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608510/extras/fdf2424cd092d77008b46ae60ca16e35.poster.avif?t=1719524631\" width=540 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608510/extras/fdf2424cd092d77008b46ae60ca16e35.webm?t=1719524631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608510/extras/fdf2424cd092d77008b46ae60ca16e35.mp4?t=1719524631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Who says you have to be perfect to win?<br>Surviving is the key<br>Dazzle your enemies with your rhythm<br>And they will respond with kindness(?)<br><br>I know you can do it! I believe in you! (\u3065 \uffe3 \u00b3\uffe3)\u3065<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608510/extras/60c0915e57f7851a6975ac66066c3249.poster.avif?t=1719524631\" width=540 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608510/extras/60c0915e57f7851a6975ac66066c3249.webm?t=1719524631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608510/extras/60c0915e57f7851a6975ac66066c3249.mp4?t=1719524631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>[Gameplay]</strong><br>Attack with the music and dodge the enemies around you.<br>Enemies will also spawn and attack with the rhythm.<br>Easy, right? \u30fe(*\u00b4 \u2207 `)\uff89<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608510/extras/2e1acac47d646fca1cdc2f22abe989bc.poster.avif?t=1719524631\" width=540 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608510/extras/2e1acac47d646fca1cdc2f22abe989bc.webm?t=1719524631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608510/extras/2e1acac47d646fca1cdc2f22abe989bc.mp4?t=1719524631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>[Features]</strong><br>A combination of rhythm and bullet-hell<br>With simple shapes inspired by \u201cJust Shapes &amp; Beats\u201d and \u201cOsu!\u201d<br>Various characters with unique attacks and distinct list of music to challenge<br>Different enemies will try to stop your music<br>All songs and difficulties are unlocked by default<br>21 songs by default, but more will be added in future updates!<br>Just remember to have a good time! \u2282(\u2580\u00af\u2580\u2282 ) <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608510/extras/bb7d4a98ad30dbd23e43cdcaae8fe2f6.poster.avif?t=1719524631\" width=540 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608510/extras/bb7d4a98ad30dbd23e43cdcaae8fe2f6.webm?t=1719524631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608510/extras/bb7d4a98ad30dbd23e43cdcaae8fe2f6.mp4?t=1719524631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Twitter:@FeverNightDev","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2608510?t=1719524631","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2608510?t=1719524631","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608